:" ceremony without hand-rolling CTAP2 plumbing, PIN retry, or extension wiring.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the bundled ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FidoUI"},{"text":" module for transport selection (USB-C \/ Lightning \/ NFC on iOS, HID on macOS) and for the PIN, UV, error, and success panels.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"By bypassing WebKit’s built-in WebAuthn implementation you get full control over which authenticator handles the request, the look and feel of the prompts, and access to extensions that the platform doesn’t otherwise surface.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Architecture Overview","anchor":"Architecture-Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The sample itself is intentionally thin:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Interceptor.js","type":"text"}]},{"text":" — injected into the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WKWebView"},{"text":" to monkey-patch ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"navigator.credentials.{create,get}"},{"text":" and shuttle requests\/responses through ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WKScriptMessageHandler"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"WebView.swift","type":"text"}]},{"text":" — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIViewRepresentable"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSViewRepresentable"},{"text":" wrapper that installs the script, registers message handlers, and coordinates ceremony lifecycle (cancel on dismiss, cancel-and-replace on a new request).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"WebAuthnHandler.swift","type":"text"}]},{"text":" — decodes the JSON envelope, builds a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","isActive":true},{"text":", and calls ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FidoUI.makeCredential"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FidoUI.getAssertion"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"ContentView.swift","type":"text"}]},{"text":" — minimal SwiftUI shell with a URL bar and back button.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"FidoUI","type":"text"}]},{"text":" (separate Swift package under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Samples\/WebAuthnInterceptorSample\/FidoUI"},{"text":") — the reusable UI + transport layer described below.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The end-to-end flow:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Page JS calls ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"navigator.credentials.create()"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".get()"},{"text":"; the interceptor serializes the options as WebAuthn Level 3 JSON and posts it to Swift.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WebAuthnHandler"},{"text":" decodes the JSON straight into the SDK’s strongly-typed ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Options"},{"text":" and hands them to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FidoUI"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FidoUI"},{"text":" opens a transport, runs the ceremony via ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Client","isActive":true},{"text":", and shows PIN